<p local-id=3D"e2e9bbe52a0a">Color Code: <br><span style=3D"background-colo=
r: rgb(254,222,200);">Questions needing to be answered</span><br><span styl=
e=3D"background-color: rgb(198,237,251);">API Call to build</span><br><span=
 style=3D"background-color: rgb(223,216,253);">Salesforce Field Updated/pop=
ulated</span><br><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(211,241,167);">Opport=
unity Stage Form Needed</span></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"07665cfe4ccc" id=3D"ExportControlScreenings(CSL)-ExportCont=
rolScreenings(CSL)">Export Control Screenings (CSL)</h1>
