</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout two-equal" data-layout=3D"two-equal">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<h2 local-id=3D"fef24d4ef4d4" id=3D"ExportControlScreenings(CSL)-Fieldsneed=
edatAccountlevel">Fields needed at Account level</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"b0309649c30e">
<li local-id=3D"72519d2b982a">
<p local-id=3D"78c79a9de561"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(223,216,2=
53);">=E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening List=E2=80=9D</span></p>
<ul local-id=3D"86f7a1192433">
<li local-id=3D"5d927baab679">
<p local-id=3D"3bc1aada7e0e">Pick list: Not Screened (default), Approved, O=
n hold, Additional Screening Needed, Denied</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"35a8953c28cc">
<p local-id=3D"197c88a0cb51">Only Customer Operations can edit this field (=
View All)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e010f21a9e66">
<p local-id=3D"4343b79f1cb3"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(223,216,2=
53);">=E2=80=9CDate of Last CSL Run=E2=80=9D: mm.dd.yy</span></p>
<ul local-id=3D"bef7b2d042ab">
<li local-id=3D"fd7ac4f1ce41">
<p local-id=3D"4c9f35bbd140">Need to see history of these statuses</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a95d8c5198ee">
<p local-id=3D"6a19e6275487">Only Customer Operations can edit this field (=
View All)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"3d9d4b0311be">
<p local-id=3D"9254387aa0be"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(223,216,2=
53);">Offensive Security Screening Notes</span>: (Multi text field)</p>
<ul local-id=3D"442d2670b0f5">
<li local-id=3D"9b5d8f4aa89f">
<p local-id=3D"f495b14fe238">Hidden Field (Permission Group=3DOffensive Sec=
urity Screening) - can only can view and edit)</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7f099cd90769">
<li local-id=3D"175c630a1b7e">
<p local-id=3D"a449f5d1cf38">Permission Group (2 people Victoria Mullady &a=
mp; Alex Guderian)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"76a196717cc9" id=3D"ExportControlScreenings(CSL)-*Fieldsnee=
dedatOpportunitylevel">*Fields needed at Opportunity level</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"5b861741bcb9">
<li local-id=3D"64a86b216905">
<p local-id=3D"0ce2ad849870"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(223,216,2=
53);">=E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening Status=E2=80=9D </span></p>
<ul local-id=3D"f1bac56d5ab4">
<li local-id=3D"570cffde6e40">
<p local-id=3D"47249618b8ef">Pick list: Not Screened (default), Approved, O=
n hold, Additional Screening Needed, Denied</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9d1260d15ff8">
<p local-id=3D"194bd331e4a3">Greyed out or hidden on Renewal Opps (not depe=
ndent on renewal opps proceeding)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"421881b02e1c">
<p local-id=3D"02677c36c22b">See below notes for all automations/dependenci=
es related to this field</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<h2 local-id=3D"a8645e03e2e3" id=3D"ExportControlScreenings(CSL)-ExternalAP=
I-Automation">External API - Automation</h2>
<h4 local-id=3D"996198665cb4" id=3D"ExportControlScreenings(CSL)-RunstheCSL=
API-http://ocr-inc.com/"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(198,237,251);=
">Runs the CSL API - </span><a class=3D"external-link" data-card-appearance=
=3D"inline" href=3D"http://ocr-inc.com/" local-id=3D"3370518cf006" rel=3D"n=
ofollow">http://ocr-inc.com/</a></h4>
<ul local-id=3D"b047eb42ded3">
<li local-id=3D"e7d93380e3d3">
<p local-id=3D"90d3179e8c24">Utilize Descartes tool API Connection to Fortr=
a Salesforce (tool managed by Legal)</p>
<ul local-id=3D"468a72459b35">
<li local-id=3D"13231e6ac029">
<p local-id=3D"e3157eca3cb4">Data sent through API</p>
<ul local-id=3D"3bcf6d79000f">
<li local-id=3D"2cbbea0a59b3">
<p local-id=3D"3cf3a07fb850">Account Name (Company Name)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bd4a8ade522f">
<p local-id=3D"589e90008725">Account ID (Salesforce ID)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"151b48b999c5">
<p local-id=3D"ff79206527ac">Account Ship to Address</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"cbd092e4800e">
<p local-id=3D"9acbb1a23a40">Returns <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(2=
23,216,253);">=E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening List=E2=80=9D</span> Status (=
On Hold or Approved)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"f31b3858988a" id=3D"ExportControlScreenings(CSL)-ICANLookup=
-Manualtoday-thiswouldjustbenicetohaveorPhase2">ICAN Lookup - Manual today =
- this would just be nice to have or Phase 2</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"3e3e219cf223">
<li local-id=3D"5b5d9bd3df09">
<p local-id=3D"36f34f35b33f">API pull <a class=3D"external-link" data-card-=
appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"https://opendata.icann.org/api/v1/console/dat=
asets/1.0/search/" local-id=3D"8ab4bf195382" rel=3D"nofollow">https://opend=
ata.icann.org/api/v1/console/datasets/1.0/search/</a></p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<hr local-id=3D"8669a4863170">
<h2 local-id=3D"678b4fa2a09e" id=3D"ExportControlScreenings(CSL)-Process1:N=
ewSaleOpportunities-allFortraProducts(NotRenewals)">Process 1: New Sale Opp=
ortunities - all Fortra Products (Not Renewals)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"59e3314d80a0"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(254,222,2=
00);">New Global Quote rule needed: </span></p>
<p local-id=3D"07a195941676"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(254,222,2=
00);">
<del>*Quote Watermark Removal Rule: Once Quote is approved and =E2=80=9CCon=
solidated Screening Status=E2=80=9D =3D Approved</del></span>- this should =
be satisfied by recent development for Oppty/Quotes in UAT Env (See <a clas=
s=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://loop.cloud.microsoft/p/eyJwIjp7InUiOiJo=
dHRwczovL2hlbHBzeXN0ZW1zbGxjLW15LnNoYXJlcG9pbnQuY29tL3BlcnNvbmFsL2JyaWdldHR=
lX2NvbHVjY2lfaGVscHN5c3RlbXNfY29tP25hdj1jejBsTWtad1pYSnpiMjVoYkNVeVJtSnlhV2=
RsZEhSbFgyTnZiSFZqWTJsZmFHVnNjSE41YzNSbGJYTmZZMjl0Sm1ROVlpRlFWakkxV0RkVFpUT=
kZaWFIyVjNGSFJqbGphMnhwYmtGd00yUTNkemhDU1dsSlYweGlUR2xUYVRCM1pUTnpjRXBGVkhS=
eFUwcDNiemt4UVVRM05USjJKbVk5TURGTlJFZzFNME5UUVVFMlRrZFJWbEV6UlU1SU0wUk1TVmR=
ZTlRKT05WbzFOaVpqUFNabWJIVnBaRDB4IiwiciI6ZmFsc2V9fQ%3D%3D" rel=3D"nofollow"=
>Notes</a>)</p>
<ul local-id=3D"f1c0eb26a183">
<li local-id=3D"ad059db38699">
<p local-id=3D"08dbf55d5b7f">Trigger @ Opportunity Created</p>
<ul local-id=3D"e4a725cbb792">
<li local-id=3D"c5f69140a2e6">
<p local-id=3D"f87bd77298b6"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(198,237,2=
51);">Run the CSL API</span></p>
<ul local-id=3D"d71f08d08a33">
<li local-id=3D"87e178827054">
<p local-id=3D"ee0890c0bfb7"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(198,237,2=
51);">CSL Returns =3D On Hold</span></p>
<ul local-id=3D"8f5e8226f844">
<li local-id=3D"1df5fd96f129">
<p local-id=3D"3ea31bbdbcf0">Update Account Field <span style=3D"background=
-color: rgb(223,216,253);">=E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening List=E2=80=9D =
=3D On Hold</span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8d66a36e3716">
<p local-id=3D"3b4dedcee72c">Update Opportunity Field <span style=3D"backgr=
ound-color: rgb(220,223,228);">=E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening Status=E2=80=
=9D</span> =3D On Hold</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"849b276495bb">
<p local-id=3D"69e3874b8834">Opportunity: Customer Operations review needed=
 <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(254,222,200);">Will be viewed through=
 Que where </span><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,223,228);">=E2=
=80=9CConsolidated Screening Status=E2=80=9D</span> =3D On Hold</p>
<ul local-id=3D"0eb914b3b95b">
<li local-id=3D"e8fa27a7fd2e">
<p local-id=3D"6e2a7e35bd7a">Once complete Customer Operations will manuall=
y update Update Opportunity Field <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,=
223,228);">=E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening Status=E2=80=9D</span> =3D (resu=
lting status value)</p>
<ul local-id=3D"eb3347393c5d">
<li local-id=3D"505d4ecfb563">
<p local-id=3D"5d067f3a35da">If possible, only if set manually by customer =
ops Automatically Update Account Field <span style=3D"background-color: rgb=
(223,216,253);">=E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening List=E2=80=9D =3D Approved =
or Denied</span></p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"e66897854adf">
<p local-id=3D"3695c1261cc0"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(198,237,2=
51);">CSL Returns =3D Approved</span></p>
<ul local-id=3D"3577d77c1b1c">
<li local-id=3D"6f15f0b5a795">
<p local-id=3D"e9a5d281147e"><strong>Opportunity Product of interest =3D Of=
fensive Security</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"4164c2623f1d">
<li local-id=3D"d6f549734feb">
<p local-id=3D"6dd0c9512ff7">Update Account Field <span style=3D"background=
-color: rgb(223,216,253);">=E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening List=E2=80=9D</s=
pan> =3D <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(223,216,253);">Additional Scr=
eening Needed</span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d4db89bd5ed7">
<p local-id=3D"ae67c26c2457">Update Opportunity Field <span style=3D"backgr=
ound-color: rgb(220,223,228);">=E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening Status=E2=80=
=9D</span> =3D <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,223,228);">Addition=
al Screening Needed</span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4b3ac706bc1b">
<p local-id=3D"244c3350f1de"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(211,241,1=
67);">(today external Microsoft form) Trigger Sales Rep to fill out form: =
=E2=80=9CExport Screening Request=E2=80=9D</span></p>
<ul local-id=3D"5465d0f5812f">
<li local-id=3D"9e9b864117e3">
<p local-id=3D"703b0c011ddf"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(211,241,1=
67);">Questions asked: (Allow Multiple)</span> <span style=3D"background-co=
lor: rgb(211,241,167);">Select Contact from system - </span></p>
<ul local-id=3D"c99487ea4442">
<li local-id=3D"05a081afb722">
<p local-id=3D"234a46331e5a"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(211,241,1=
67);">End user name (person not company) </span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ffd71888691c">
<p local-id=3D"5ee6995e5c87"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(211,241,1=
67);">End user Title: (this is required) </span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2f58bcf0003c">
<p local-id=3D"429835984a54"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(211,241,1=
67);">Shipping Country (Country of End user Location) </span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"265d3d7ef8f9">
<p local-id=3D"34bf5232fd53"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(211,241,1=
67);">Required Text Field: Detailed Use Case (Multi text field)</span></p><=
/li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"bed05f00f1b7">
<p local-id=3D"700e98cc613c">Opportunity: Customer Operations review needed=
 <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(254,222,200);">Will be viewed through=
 Queue where </span><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,223,228);">=E2=
=80=9CConsolidated Screening Status=E2=80=9D</span> =3D Additional Screenin=
g Required</p>
<ul local-id=3D"27fd4e52b8b7">
<li local-id=3D"8be3f785336b">
<p local-id=3D"9760f2ecefe9"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(254,222,2=
00);">(nice to have manual process today) ICANN lookup - Country code manua=
l lookup if ICANN comes back with nothing. </span></p>
<ul local-id=3D"9791b073c14f">
<li local-id=3D"4442a807b9ef">
<p local-id=3D"7dc1e7b2fd45"><span style=3D"background-color: rgb(254,222,2=
00);">Results will be copied/pasted (manually to start, eventually automate=
d if possible) into the Export Screening Notes field - if text exists in th=
e field, we need to append to the end of the pre-existing text (leave a bla=
nk line).</span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0edad3604fe9">
<p local-id=3D"83eb82b20da9">Manual research, google, map, real company/end=
 user etc.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"1e60689ececa">
<p local-id=3D"217537524ed8">Once complete Customer Operations will manuall=
y update Update Opportunity Field <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(220,=
223,228);">=E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening Status=E2=80=9D</span> =3D Appro=
ved or Denied result</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e24d7b58769a">
<p local-id=3D"882f0dd18ce2">When the above Consolidated Screening Status (=
oppty) field changed, automatically Update Account Field <span style=3D"bac=
kground-color: rgb(223,216,253);">=E2=80=9CConsolidated Screening List=E2=
=80=9D</span> =3D <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(223,216,253);">Appro=
ved or Denied result</span></p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"ffedd93eeb0c">
<p local-id=3D"d2479d74c752"><strong>Opportunity Product of interest =3D Em=
ail Security (Secure ICAP Gateway, Secure Email Gateway)</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"4ddb063a307a">
<li local-id=3D"f8843f3a23fa">
