<h3 local-id=3D"467387bba55a" id=3D"ExportControlScreenings(CSL)-Quarterlyb=
ulkreviews(AllProducts)">Quarterly bulk reviews (All Products)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"26d6d77e4600">*Current: Manual export and upload of excels q=
uarterly to the <span style=3D"background-color: rgb(198,237,251);">CSL web=
site</span>.</p>
