a1g?e=3DLb62W9" rel=3D"nofollow">Quarterly Batch Export Screening Process 2=
025.docx</a></p>
<p local-id=3D"510383f67053" style=3D"margin-left: 30.0px;">[Future State (=
Nice to Have) If it=E2=80=99s possible to directly upload records to OCR/De=
scartes (or other vendor) switch to nightly rescreen process.=E2=80=AF If s=
anctions are lifted, alerts are automatically updated and automatically cle=
ars holds.]</p>
<p local-id=3D"f4470a7dfa41"><strong>Automation To build (Request)</strong>=
<br>
Export Screening process batch screening of all active customers periodical=
ly (quarterly)</p>
